1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,120
Oh, my daddy taught me something that I hold on to today

2
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,560
How to hear what people mean when they can't find the words to say

3
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:12,320
He listened past the talking to the quiet underneath

4
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:15,920
He could hear a heart that's hurting and a fire between the teeth

5
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:19,680
So when somebody tells me that they're alright and looks away

6
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:23,280
I can hear my daddy's lesson, and I pull up close and stay

7
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:27,120
It's the best thing that he gave me, and it never cost a dime

8
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:30,560
Just a pair of ears that listen and a little bit of time

9
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:34,320
Some brothers share your last name, some brothers share your scars

10
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:38,080
Some you meet in the middle of the night under the same hot stars

11
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:41,760
And when it's all been said and done, I hope they say it about me

12
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:45,440
He truly lived for others, the realest good man you could meet

13
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,340
So here's something you can do before the sun goes down today
